<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0688_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brent</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By the way, you a Poké Maniac...\nI can tell. Yeah, you.\rBut your knowledge still SHALLOW!\rYou know Bill?\nHe a INCREDIBLE Poké Maniac.\fI worship him. I have a shrine.\rI’ll teach you ALL I know about Bill,\nso leave me your number. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill--he more than amazin’!\rBein’ a Poké Maniac like him...\nThat’s my dream.\fI wear his exact glasses. They ain’t\fprescription.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You DEFINITELY gon’ regret that...\nBill would be ashamed of you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ll teach you all I know about Bill,\nso leave me your number. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? You like talkin’ to people nearby\non the phone?\rYou know, this how I talk to my mama\nwhen I’m home? From the basement.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, I got a SUPER rare homie in a\ntrade a while back.\rYou wanna know what it is?\nHehe, that’s a SECRET!\rIt’s a RATTATA. A shiny one. Maybe.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, I took down this wild\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rIt wasn’t rare enough to bother\ncatchin’.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, I saw a rare homie about a\nhour ago.\rFirst time seein’ it. But I had no Nap\nSacks...\rWould Bill laugh at me?\nBill would never. Bill’s kind.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nBill’s pops supposed to be a\fgreat Poké Maniac.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nApparently Bill’s grandpa ain’t a\fPoké Maniac.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nBill originally from Goldenrod.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nBill apparently live on Route 25 in\fKanto.\fI’ve been to his house. Outside it.\fFor research.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nABRA was apparently the first homie\fBill ever caught.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...? Bill’s lil sister\napparently can’t wink.\fShe blinks with both eyes.\fIt’s adorable. I’ve seen it. Twice.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nBill supposedly HATE milk and can’t\fdrink it.\fI quit milk too. In solidarity.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nApparently, Bill ain’t that good at\fscrappin’.\fThat’s FINE. He’s a genius. Genius\fdon’t need to scrap.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nBill look like he got a crush on the\fFlower Shop lady.\fI’m happy for him. I’m FINE.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nThey say Bill’s mama used to be\fa Dancer.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know...?\nThey say Bill’s mama used to be\fa Dancer.\rSo that’s that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got time like always, right?\nFeel like a scrap?\rYou’ll get to see my rare homie.\nIt’s worth it!\rYou know where--{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna see my rare homie?\nHurry over to {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0688_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanted to hear about Bill?\rMy bad, but I’m too busy for you.\nI’m reorganizin’ my Bill scrapbook.\rI’ll call when I got time.\nGood looks!</language>
	</row>
</body>
